    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TWA\nSYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEFFECTIVE MARCH 18, 1973\nTWA is\nwhat travel\nshould be.\nNot just a slogan-\nbut a commitment.",
      "SAN\nFRANCISCO /OAKLAND\nDENVER\nANGELES\nLAS VEGAS\nALBUQUERQUE\nPHOENIX\nTUCSON\nAMARILLO\nDETROIT\nCHICAGE\nINDIANAPOLIS\nKANSAS CITY\nST. LO\nSGLEVELAND\nPITTSBURGH\nHARRISBURG\nCOLUMBUS\n•CINCINNATI\n• LOUISVILLE\nBOSTON\nHARTFORD\nNEW YORK\nPHILADELPHIA\nALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nWICHITA\n• TULSA\n• HASHVILLE\nOKLAHOMA\nCITY\n→ ATLANTA\nTAMPA\n• MIAMI\nTWA\nWORLD\nROUTES\nSHANNON\nO FRANKFURT\nLONDON\nPARIS\n•ZURICH\nGENEVA • OMILAN\nMADRID\nROME\nLISBON\nSANTA\nMARIA\nATHENS\nTEL AVIV\nCAIRO\nHONG KONG\nBOMBAY\nBANGKOK\nOKINAWA\nTAIPE!\n• HONOLULU\nGUAM\nNAIROBI\nNOT ALL OF TWA'S NONSTOP\nROUTES ARE INDICATED."
